            <div class="kh-form-group">
                <label class="kh-form-label" for="contractor-dynamics">2. How would you describe your experience with how the third-party contractors and technical details were managed on the ground?</label>
                <textarea id="contractor-dynamics" name="contractor_dynamics" class="kh-form-control" placeholder="Your thoughts..." required></textarea>
            </div>

            <div class="kh-form-group">
                <label class="kh-form-label" for="standout-moments">3. Were there any specific technical updates, reports, or moments during the build that particularly stood out to you—either positive or negative?</label>
                <textarea id="standout-moments" name="standout_moments" class="kh-form-control" placeholder="Your thoughts..." required></textarea>
            </div>

            <div class="kh-form-group">
                <label class="kh-form-label" for="operational-critique">4. What is one thing I could improve or do differently next time to make the process, the data sharing, or the communication smoother for you?</label>
                <textarea id="operational-critique" name="operational_critique" class="kh-form-control" placeholder="Your thoughts..." required></textarea>
            </div>

            <div class="kh-form-group">
                <label class="kh-form-label" for="coupon-context">5. Since your 30% Golden Ticket Pass for our P-008 Deep Technical Audit is fully transferable, what kind of property scenarios or investor profiles do you think would get the most practical use out of it?</label>
                <textarea id="coupon-context" name="coupon_context" class="kh-form-control" placeholder="Your thoughts..." required></textarea>
            </div>

            <div class="kh-form-group">
                <label class="kh-form-label">6. Overall Service Evaluation</label>
                <div class="kh-rating-stars">
                    <input type="radio" id="star5" name="service_rating" value="5" required/><label for="star5">★</label>
                    <input type="radio" id="star4" name="service_rating" value="4"/><label for="star4">★</label>
                    <input type="radio" id="star3" name="service_rating" value="3"/><label for="star3">★</label>
                    <input type="radio" id="star2" name="sharing_consent_fix_2" value="2" style="display:none;" />
                    <input type="radio" name="service_rating" id="star2" value="2" class="kh-radio-input" style="display:none;"/>
                    <input type="radio" name="q_rating" id="r5" value="5" class="kh-radio-input hidden" style="display:none;"/>
                    <input type="radio" name="overall_rating" id="star5" value="5" class="kh-radio-input" required/>
                    <label for="star5" title="5 stars" class="order-1">★</label>
                    
                    <input type="radio" name="overall_rating" id="star4" value="4" class="kh-radio-input"/>
                    <label for="star4" title="4 stars" class="order-2">★</label>
                    
                    <input type="radio" name="overall_rating" value="3" class="kh-radio-input"/>
                    <label for="star3" class="order-3">★</label>
                    
                    <input type="radio" name="overall_rating" value="2" class="kh-radio-input"/>
                    <label class="order-4">★</label>
                    
                    <input type="radio" name="overall_rating" value="1" class="kh-radio-input"/>
                    <label class="order-5">★</label>
                </div>
                <div class="kh-rating-stars" style="display: flex; flex-direction: row-reverse; justify-content: flex-end; gap: 4px;">
                    <input type="radio" id="rating-5" name="rating" value="5" required style="appearance:none; -webkit-appearance:none; margin:0; cursor:pointer;" />
                    <label onclick="document.getElementById('rating-5').checked = true" style="cursor:pointer; font-size:2rem; color:var(--kh-star-color);" onmouseover="this.style.color='#f59e0b'" onmouseout="this.style.color=''">★</label>
                    <input type="radio" id="rating-4" name="rating" value="4" style="appearance:none; -webkit-appearance:none; margin:0; cursor:pointer;" />
                    <label onclick="document.getElementById('rating-4').checked = true" style="cursor:pointer; font-size:2rem; color:var(--kh-star-color);">★</label>
                    <input type="radio" id="rating-3" name="rating" value="3" style="appearance:none; -webkit-appearance:none; margin:0; cursor:pointer;" />
                    <label onclick="document.getElementById('rating-3').checked = true" style="cursor:pointer; font-size:2rem; color:var(--kh-star-color);">★</label>
                    <input type="radio" id="rating-2" name="rating" value="2" style="appearance:none; -webkit-appearance:none; margin:0; cursor:pointer;" />
                    <label onclick="document.getElementById('rating-2').checked = true" style="cursor:pointer; font-size:2rem; color:var(--kh-star-color);">★</label>
                    <input type="radio" id="rating-1" name="rating" value="1" style="appearance:none; -webkit-appearance:none; margin:0; cursor:pointer;" />
