                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="kh-form-group">
                <label class="kh-form-label">7. Public Sharing Consent</label>
                <p class="kh-form-hint" style="font-style: normal; margin-bottom: 12px; font-size: 0.95rem;">I am updating the KLEHOMERIE website soon. If your feedback describes our mission perfectly, may I feature a snippet of it as a success story?</p>
                
                <div class="kh-radio-stack">
                    <label class="kh-radio-label">
                        <input type="radio" name="public_consent" value="full-name" class="kh-radio-input" required />
